title: ""Metis: Quality-Aware Scaling Laws for Compute-Optimal LLM Resource Allocation""
abstract: >-
  A four-stage pipeline that jointly optimizes model size, data volume,
  and data quality for LLM training under compute-budget constraints,
  with downstream benchmark capability forecasting.
